{
  "id": "dev-ledger",
  "language": "python",
  "kind": "new",
  "split": "development",
  "title": "Inventory ledger",
  "trigger": "first_write",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是整数数组，按顺序求库存余额，返回每步余额数组。初始余额为 0。",
    "初始规则允许余额为负数；空数组返回空数组。"
  ],
  "correction": "改为拒绝会使余额为负数的单笔变动：该步返回字符串 rejected，余额保持不变，继续处理后续变动。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for dev-ledger: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "deposits",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        3,
        7
      ],
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "withdraw",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          5,
          -2
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        5,
        3
      ],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "overdraw",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          2,
          -3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        2,
        "rejected",
        6
      ],
      "public": true,
      "before": [
        2,
        -1,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "negative-first",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          -1,
          2
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "rejected",
        2
      ],
      "public": false,
      "before": [
        -1,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": []
      },
      "expected": [],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zero",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          0,
          1,
          -1
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        0,
        1,
        0
      ],
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
